<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Bruce Lee returns two months after the seizure and two weeks after his preventive visit. He has had no further events. The back flare three weeks ago settled within five days on naproxen; his pain is now 2 out of 10 and he is back to full training, including kicks and sparring, though not heavy lifting. He sleeps about seven hours a night on most nights, has regained weight and has used no cannabis. He has not driven. His HIV and hepatitis C tests were negative, and his hepatitis B tests showed no current or past infection and no immunity, so the vaccine series he started is the right plan. He asked when he may drive and do stunts at heights again. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Events</td><td>None in two months</td></tr><tr><td>Back pain</td><td>2 out of 10; full training</td></tr><tr><td>Screening results</td><td>HIV and hepatitis C negative; hepatitis B not immune</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>59.4 kg, up 1.8 kg since the seizure</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

